    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλῡφάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλύω</span>
			, only pres. and impf., <i>roll
			along</i>, 
